  "description": "LEGO 6286-1  *Skull's Eye Schooner*  - also known as *The Black Skull*\n\n![](https://images.brickset.com/sets/images/6286-1.jpg)\n\nA classic lego set first realeased in 1993 as part of the *Pirates* theme. The set came with nine minifigures, a parrot, monkey and shark. \nThe four cannons on the deck could rotate and in the none-US version the cannons could fire the small Round 1x1 Brick.\n\nThere would be two hatched to open compartents in the bow and in the stern the sides could rotate out and its roof could removed further exposing its interior.\n\nAnother interesting note is that it came with a functioning compass.\n![](http://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/PN/11/70001pb02.png)\n\nCreated using bricklink studio\nhttps://www.bricklink.com/v3/studio/download.page",
